  m_Name: Message from a pelotudo to otro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: I can not believe the amount of people that are migrating to the cold
    side of Proima. I keep telling them the invasion is not real but they are to
    stupid to listen, not like us. Planets change, that is how nature works. This
    is clearly some ruse by the government to make us panic and control us.
